<font size="64">Kang Hoon is no joke.</font>

396
00:09:16,830 --> 00:09:18,160
<font size="64">A kiss between comedy club members?</font>

397
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,900
<font size="64">Wait. E Dam,</font>

398
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:21,800
<font size="64">- do you have a sister? - I have an older sister.</font>

399
00:09:21,870 --> 00:09:23,330
<font size="64">- You do? - How old is she?</font>

400
00:09:23,330 --> 00:09:24,900
<font size="64">- She's five years older than me. - Oh, dear.</font>

401
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:26,670
<font size="64">Is your sister's name Lee Il Dam?</font>

402
00:09:26,900 --> 00:09:28,940
<font size="64">My real name is actually different.</font>

403
00:09:27,270 --> 00:09:28,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Serious)</font>

404
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:30,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Failed joke)</font>

405
00:09:30,070 --> 00:09:31,610
<font size="64">- What was that? - What's your real name?</font>

406
00:09:31,610 --> 00:09:33,310
<font size="64">My real name is Baek Hye Won.</font>

407
00:09:33,310 --> 00:09:35,280
<font size="64">- Hye Won. - It's a pretty name.</font>

408
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,410
<font size="64">Baek Hye Won? I like it.</font>

409
00:09:36,410 --> 00:09:38,020
<font size="64">- Hye Won. - Haha.</font>

410
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:40,350
<font size="64">Calling her sister Il Dam was a bit...</font>

411
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,890
<font size="64">- That was a tactless remark. - Il Dam?</font>

412
00:09:41,890 --> 00:09:43,490
<font size="64">- Maybe if you said "Hu Il Dam." - I know.</font>

413
00:09:43,490 --> 00:09:45,660
<font size="64">Is it because Hye Won is a common name?</font>

414
00:09:44,490 --> 00:09:47,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Why did she choose E Dam instead of Hye Won?)</font>

415
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,560
<font size="64">- Is that why? - When I started my acting career,</font>

416
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:51,430
<font size="64">I wanted to use a gender-neutral name.</font>

417
00:09:51,330 --> 00:09:53,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Endless reactions)</font>

418
00:09:51,430 --> 00:09:53,800
<font size="64">- Right. You have such a vibe. - At first... Yes.</font>

419
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:56,930
<font size="64">By the way, though we're close to Kang Hoon,</font>

420
00:09:56,930 --> 00:09:58,340
<font size="64">we're not talking to him at all.</font>

421
00:09:57,500 --> 00:09:59,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sorry)</font>

422
00:09:58,340 --> 00:09:59,840
<font size="64">- It's okay. - Hey.</font>

423
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,310
<font size="64">You still can't eat kimchi?</font>

424
00:10:01,310 --> 00:10:02,770
