425
00:10:02,770 --> 00:10:04,340
<font size="64">He wouldn't suddenly start eating it.</font>

426
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:05,540
<font size="64">It's something he couldn't eat his whole life.</font>

427
00:10:05,540 --> 00:10:06,710
<font size="64">- He has trauma. - By the way,</font>

428
