431
00:10:08,350 --> 00:10:11,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He doesn't.)</font>

432
00:10:11,150 --> 00:10:12,920
<font size="64">- What about kimchi fried rice? - I eat stew, though.</font>

433
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,420
