434
00:10:14,150 --> 00:10:16,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The attention finally shifted after mentioning kimchi.)</font>

435
00:10:14,420 --> 00:10:16,320
<font size="64">- Even kimchi fried rice? - Yes.</font>

436
00:10:16,450 --> 00:10:18,620
<font size="64">The happiness kimchi brings is huge, though.</font>

437
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:18,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What a shame.)</font>

438
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,960
