443
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:28,900
<font size="64">- Dongchimi? - I don't eat dongchimi.</font>

444
00:10:28,900 --> 00:10:30,030
<font size="64">Green onion kimchi?</font>

445
00:10:30,030 --> 00:10:31,340
<font size="64">- I don't eat it. - How can someone not eat kimchi?</font>

446
00:10:30,270 --> 00:10:32,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She can't understand it.)</font>

447
00:10:31,340 --> 00:10:34,470
<font size="64">So I don't eat naengmyeon made with dongchimi broth.</font>

448
00:10:32,670 --> 00:10:35,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Retorter's taste hasn't changed.)</font>

449
00:10:34,470 --> 00:10:36,110
<font size="64">- You can't eat it? - I see.</font>

